  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Protactinium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Pa</mi></mfenced></math> is the element that does not have stable electronic configuration.</p><p>Protactinium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Pa</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Rn</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>7</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> (Atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>91</mn></math>)</p><p>Nobelium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>No</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mi>Rn</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mn>7</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;(Atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>102</mn></math>)</p><p>Lawrencium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Lr</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Rn</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>7</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> (Atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>103</mn></math>)</p><p>Americium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Am</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Rn</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mn>7</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> (Atomic number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</m